<title>JAPAN: M'bishi Corp files 500 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>M'bishi Corp files 500 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading house Mitsubishi Corp said on Monday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 500 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective for two years from May 16.</p>
</text>
